        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In consideration for implementation of the 1.25% market adjustment for the security classifications effective January 1, 2006, the Parties agree to grant all employees who have been continuously employed since January 1, 2004 shall receive a lump sum payment of one-hundred twenty-five dollars ($125.00) in lieu of interest arbitration. Part time employees will receive a pro-rata share of the one-hundred twenty-five dollars ($125.00). This payment shall be made on the March 1, 2006 paycheck to eligible employees.",
